# Quick-edit · Option C — full sheet mode (keyboard nav)

The "feels exactly like the Vendors sheet" version. A **Sheet mode** toggle makes the whole grid
live-editable with a selected/active cell, arrow-key navigation, fill-down, and paste-a-block.

