## Interaction
- Type-to-replace, fill-down a column, paste a rectangular block straight from Google Sheets.
- Commits batch per row; same `updateInstance` underneath, just many at once.
- Biggest lift: focus/selection management, keyboard grid, paste→field mapping, undo.

**Fork this represents:** the **phase-2 vision**. Best done *after* Option A ships — A is the
foundation (per-kind cell editors + version-checked save); C adds the keyboard/selection layer on top.
